58
00:02:59.317 --> 00:03:03.162
I try to get a good score, but having fun is more important.

59
00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.018
Playing fair makes everyone happy.

60
00:03:08.317 --> 00:03:10.946
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:11.246 --> 00:03:14.511
Sometimes we win, blank sometimes we lose.

62
00:03:14.811 --> 00:03:18.522
A, but. B, and so. C, because.

63
00:03:22.517 --> 00:03:24.505
The answer is A: but.

64
00:03:26.017 --> 00:03:28.063
The number of points you get is the blank.

65
00:03:28.363 --> 00:03:31.981
A, team. B, score. C, rule.

66
00:03:35.983 --> 00:03:37.669
The answer is B: score.

67
00:03:39.183 --> 00:03:41.044
Your time to play is your blank.

68
00:03:41.344 --> 00:03:44.533
A, turn. B, game. C, fair.

69
00:03:48.517 --> 00:03:50.957
The answer is A: turn.

70
00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:58.074
Now it's your turn to speak. What is your favorite game to play, and what are its rules?

71
00:04:03.374 --> 00:04:08.813
My favorite game is chess. You must wait for your turn, and you can't move a piece twice.

72
00:04:09.113 --> 00:04:10.799
Excellent answer, Rithy!

73
00:04:11.783 --> 00:04:15.875
Great work today! You learned eight new words and sometimes  but .

74
00:04:16.175 --> 00:04:20.453
Today's value is fair play. Play fairly and follow the rules.

75
00:04:20.753 --> 00:04:23.603
See you in Unit six. Goodbye!

76
00:04:23.903 --> 00:04:26.880
Thank you, Ms. Sarah! Bye, everyone!

